        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka wa mirongwitatu, mu kwezi kwa kane, ku musi ugira gatanu w’ukwo kwezi, nari kumwe n’abājanywe ar’ inyagano turi ku ruzi Kebari; ijuru riruguruka, maze mbona ivyo neretswe bivuye ku Mana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
