              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko ncitegereza ivyo binyabugingo, mbona amakurudumu ahagaze hasi, imwe‐imwe i ruhande y’ivyo binyabugingo, imbere mu maso yavyo ukw ari bine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ayo makurudumu, ishusho yayo n’ uburyo yakozwe vyari bimeze nk’ akabuyenge kitwa tarushishi; kandi yose ukw ar’ ane yarasa: ishusho yayo n’uburyo yakozwe, vyasa n’ah’ umenga n’ikurudumu isobekeranye n’iyindi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.10.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 10:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iy’ agiye, yagenda yerekeye mu mpande zayo ukw ari zine: nta ho yahindukira iy’ agenda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.10.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 10:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.4.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ivyah 4:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahihese hayo hāshika hejuru biteye ubgoba; kandi yose ukw ar’ ane, ahihese hayo hāri huzuyekw amaso impande zose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
