            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uhereye ahobaye mu rukenyerero rwiwe ugasubiza ahahera haruguru, mbona ibiboneka nk’ umuringa w’umujumbu, n’igisa n’ umuriro umuziguje impande zose; kand’ uhereye ahobaye mu rukenyerero rwiwe ugasubiza ahahera hepfo, mbona umenga har’ ibisa n’umuriro, kand’ ibibatsi vyamukikiza hirya no hino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
